e INV-36705 in full by wire.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Amount:** $1,770.14\n- **Status:** Sent, verified\n\nThe amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was needed. I sent the wire once, with an idempotency key, so it can't be executed twice. The vendor's bank details are verified and it supports wire, so ACH wasn't needed.\n\nEvergreen's other invoices were not touched: INV-26556 was already paid, and INV-57940 is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}